<!--
Czech translation — full UI coverage. Tone is informal "ty"-form throughout
("Obleč si …", "Vezmi si …"). Brand name "ClothesCast" stays verbatim.

What is NOT overridden, by design:
- `app_name` — brand identifier, identical across locales.
- `insight_time_am` / `_pm` / `_midnight` / `_noon` (and the *_minutes
  variants) — English-only spoken-time formatter helpers. Czech locales
  use `insight_time_hour` / `insight_time_hour_minutes` which are
  translated below; the AM/PM keys exist for `Locale.language == "en"`
  paths only.

Picker labels under `settings_region_language_*` and
`settings_tts_voice_locale_*` give the Czech names for every offered
locale (Angličtina (USA), Francouzština (Francie), Němčina (Německo), …).
-->
